            "value": "Marché commun"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "region.sharedMigration": {
      "comment": "Shared fictional marketplace. Language changes presentation only; stable identity indices and economic outcomes remain unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your career now uses the shared market. Your cash, items, costs and existing quotes are unchanged. New listings use the same pricing rules for everyone. Your previous save was backed up."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kariyerin artık ortak pazarı kullanıyor. Nakdin, ürünlerin, maliyetlerin ve mevcut tekliflerin korundu. Yeni ilanlarda herkes için aynı fiyat kuralları geçerli. Önceki kaydın yedeklendi."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Karriere nutzt jetzt den gemeinsamen Markt. Bargeld, Artikel, Kosten und bestehende Angebote bleiben unverändert. Neue Angebote folgen für alle denselben Preisregeln. Dein vorheriger Spielstand wurde gesichert."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta carrière utilise désormais le marché commun. Ton argent, tes objets, tes coûts et tes offres existantes restent inchangés. Les nouvelles annonces suivent les mêmes règles de prix pour tous. Ta sauvegarde précédente a été conservée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "shop.title": {
      "comment": "Player-owned shop: finite window space, real capital investment, distinct customer audiences. No automatic profits.",
